>## The integral type class: instances support integer division, modulus, remainder, and parity.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term integral = typing.TypeClass{description = "Integral: instances support integer division, modulus, remainder, and parity."}
