>## The numeric type class: instances support arithmetic (addition, subtraction, multiplication, negation).
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term numeric = typing.TypeClass{description = "Numeric: instances support arithmetic (addition, subtraction, multiplication, negation)."}
