>## The ordering type class: instances support total ordering (and equality).
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term ordering = typing.TypeClass{description = "Ordering: instances support total ordering (and equality)."}
#^^^^ source.hydra keyword.other.definition.hydra
#    ^ source.hydra
#     ^^^^^^^^ source.hydra entity.name.function.hydra
#             ^ source.hydra
#              ^ source.hydra keyword.operator.equals.hydra
#               ^ source.hydra
